5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Hello everyone. To ensure our home remains a place of warmth and peace, I believe we should look at the sunlight and heating need by room and the winter habits at a house paying ahead.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree that peace is important. To understand how we've been handling things, I'd like to look into the payment log for the last twelve months and the kitchen notice about the cooler.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know if some people are paying more than others. I will look at the plug-in monitor readings room by room and the settling up when the last rooms filled.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I want to see the big picture before we jump into anything. I'll check the last twelve utility statements and the electrician's quote for the rooms to see what we're actually dealing with.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I want to know how much work this takes. I'll look at the monthly settle observed at another house and the trial run of a reconciliation template.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. By looking into both the technical costs and the emotional atmosphere of the house, we can find a path that respects everyone's needs.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,I think we've covered all the bases. It's good that we're looking at both the numbers and the feelings involved. I'm looking forward to seeing what we find so we can move forward together.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I hope we can find a way that feels fair to everyone. I'm a bit nervous, but I think it's better to know the truth than to keep wondering.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,Exactly. Let's just make sure we're all being honest about what we find. I'm curious to see if the numbers are as chaotic as they feel lately.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope so too. I just want us to find something that doesn't make anyone feel stressed or overwhelmed. I'll do my best to share what I find.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,It is heartening to see such a spirit of cooperation. Let us trust in the information we gather to guide us toward a solution that brings harmony to our shared life.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree. Let's keep this positive energy as we review our findings. I believe that by being open with each other, we can resolve these tensions and make our home feel welcoming again.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I agree. I'll be waiting to hear what everyone finds out. I hope we can all feel happy and relaxed about the bills once we decide on a new way.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'm with you all. Let's just keep it efficient. I'm ready to see if the costs are actually manageable or if we're just pretending everything is fine while the bills pile up.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll do my part. I just hope the information helps us find a way that's easy for everyone to handle. I'm ready to see the results.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
