40,2,1,talk,Servas,,"I have learned that our rooms are not equal in warmth, and that paying a fixed seasonal rate can remove the anxiety of every single switch. We must ensure no one freezes in silence.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I've found that payments have been late when people questioned the amounts, and some even avoided using the cooler to avoid arguments. It seems the current system is really hurting our relationships.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,1,talk,Minato,,"I found out that some rooms use four times more electricity than others because of heaters and computers. Also, it took a long time to agree on payments when the last rooms were filled.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,1,talk,May,,"The numbers are all over the place; February is triple August, and it's never consistent. Also, putting in meters would cost 34,000 yen per room plus annual fees. That's a huge upfront hit.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I found out that managing the bills is a lot of work. Even with a template or meters, it takes a long time to log everything and calculate what each person owes. It seems really exhausting.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,2,talk,Servas,,"It is clear that our current path leads to both physical and emotional coldness. If we continue to worry over every switch, we lose the warmth of a true home.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, it sounds like the administrative burden is just as heavy as the emotional one. If the process is exhausting, it's no wonder people get frustrated and payments end up being late.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, since the costs are so different between rooms, it feels unfair to split everything equally. But if meters are too expensive, maybe we can find another way to be fair?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, exactly. Fairness is great, but spending over 170,000 yen just to install meters seems crazy. We need a solution that doesn't require a massive payment upfront or a part-time job to manage.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with May. If the process is that exhausting, whoever does it will just get stressed. I don't want us to pick a system that makes someone feel overwhelmed every month.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,3,talk,Servas,,"We must balance fairness with simplicity. If we choose a path that is too complex, we trade our peace for precision. Perhaps a system that stabilizes the monthly cost would ease our minds.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Servas. If we prioritize a system that is easy to manage and predictable, we can stop the arguments and the late payments. We need something that restores our harmony.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I agree. If we can find a way to be fair without it being too expensive or too much work for Daisuke, that would be the best for everyone.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,3,talk,May,,"I'm with you. We can't afford a huge installation fee, and we can't have the bills swinging wildly from 9,000 to 30,000 yen. We need something predictable that doesn't turn into a monthly nightmare.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm glad you're thinking about the workload. If we can find a way that's simple and doesn't require hours of calculations, I think we'll all be much happier living here.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,2,4,talk,Servas,,It seems we are all in agreement that predictability and simplicity are the keys to our harmony. Let us now look at the options and choose the one that warms our hearts and minds.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,2,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. We've seen how the current uncertainty and the burden of calculation are affecting us. Let's choose the option that brings the most stability and peace to our home.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I agree. I want us to be fair, but not at the cost of our friendship or our free time. I'm ready to see the options and vote for the best one.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,2,4,talk,May,,I'm ready too. Let's pick something that stops the financial roller coaster and doesn't cost a fortune to set up. I'm looking for stability and a low price tag.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm ready too. I just hope the options include something that is easy to manage so that nobody has to spend their whole evening on paperwork.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
