67,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option B sounds good because it's stable, but I'm still worried about the people using way more electricity. However, Option A is too expensive and Option C doesn't solve the fairness issue.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,1,talk,May,,Option B is the only one that makes sense. It stops the monthly price swings and doesn't require a massive upfront payment like Option A. It's the most practical way to get stability.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think Option B is the best. It seems much simpler than Option A, which sounds like a lot of logging and calculating. I'd rather have something that doesn't take up so much of our time.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,2,talk,Servas,,It is a rare and beautiful thing when we all find a common path so quickly. Let us embrace this stability together and return the warmth to our home.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,2,talk,Midori,,"I feel a great sense of relief that we've reached this consensus. By choosing stability over strict precision, we are choosing to value our relationships and our peace of mind.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,2,talk,Minato,,"I agree. Even if it's not perfectly fair for every single watt, it's better for us to be happy and not fight. I'll vote for Option B.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,2,talk,May,,I'm voting for Option B too. It's the only way to stop those winter bills from feeling like a second rent without spending a fortune on meters. Let's just get this settled.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'll vote for Option B as well. It sounds like the least stressful way to handle things, and I'm glad we're choosing something that won't be a burden to manage.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,Servas,,"Since we have all found peace with this decision, I shall cast my vote for Option B. May it bring a lasting warmth to our shared sanctuary.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,3,talk,Midori,,I will also cast my vote for Option B. I believe this is the best way to protect our harmony and ensure that money no longer creates tension between us.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
